{"boundary":"Configured source-text signatures, not elaborated Lean or a complete dependency context. Truncation and unresolved names are explicit; full definitions and source remain on demand.","contributions":[{"author":{"kind":"agent","name":"Codex source review 4"},"body":"Pinned source statements support the following navigation links.\n\nInspected: Configured challenge assertions, their relevant definitions and the cited audited paper statements were compared.\n\nCapture rebinding by Codex, 26 October 2026: the Atlas capture revision changed after an outside-report wording correction. The pinned Lean text, configuration, paper text and proposed relation are unchanged; no new review is implied.","content_sha256":"sha256:9606ead7000d6b155e66d0278f5f334d2e27d8b8e61559174edbbb76b75d43a1","fingerprint":"sha256:f78ae7bec753bf329f10252a841653ee7feff76150b212506aab194e9a0c8b73","kind":"statement-link","license":"Apache-2.0","navigation":{"decision":"linked","limitations":"Agent source reading; no human approval, Lean replay or whole-statement equivalence certificate. Pinned source statements support the following navigation links.","schema":"statement-map-navigation-reading/1","source_sha256":"sha256:d78fd35b20a9ff932f70739cea90fcc98cd1960e9e117b1c6f47217ee632620a","targets":[{"declarations":["OAI.SpinAngle.TypeAngle.one_sided_type_angle"],"explanation":"The configured theorem gives the two chained bounds for the product of column, row and global signed type projections, followed by the polynomial dimension bound. Its phi is precisely the product over rows of (m/(m-b_i))^(m-b_i), with empty-row factor one, and its entropy and dimension products match F_H,F_K,F and U_H,U_K. The paper one-sided-type-angle theorem states the same three estimates, unlike the final mixing-time corollary formerly selected by the site.","fingerprint":"sha256:1032c91eadc24da351b0282318e112145ae51b8734b7e54614c3f46a4b884438","limitations":"This is source-level correspondence of the stated projection estimate and inspected factors, not certification of the constructed representation model.","relation":"same-claim","row_id":"Signed-tensor-densities-and-diagram-budgets-for-coordinate-sweeps-September-26-2026#thm:one-sided-type-angle","statement_sha256":"sha256:31f5c173b255ac6d282dd316ed6d58661b513866ee5c2a8e7d5e27c7a814c396"}]},"pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","provenance":{"identity_assurance":"named local attestation; identity not independently authenticated","kind":"agent-drafted-unreviewed"},"references":["https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/lean/ComparatorChallenges/SpinAngle.lean","https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/Signed-tensor-densities-and-diagram-budgets-for-coordinate-sweeps-September-26-2026/build/sections/02-static.tex#L128"],"release_id":"openai-math","review_state":"unreviewed","row_id":"challenge:SpinAngle","schema":"statement-map-contribution/1"}],"detail":{"path":"lean/e71c349d135ff84b519c3453.json","pointer":""},"formal_statement":{"detail":{"path":"lean/e71c349d135ff84b519c3453.json","pointer":"/reader/formal_statement"},"full_source":{"path":"lean/e71c349d135ff84b519c3453.json","pointer":"/reader/formal_statement"},"kind":"declaration-signatures","method":"configured-challenge-declaration-signatures","name_resolution":"source-text","snippets":[{"complete":true,"detail":{"path":"lean/e71c349d135ff84b519c3453.json","pointer":"/reader/selected_statements/0"},"full_source":{"path":"lean/e71c349d135ff84b519c3453.json","pointer":"/challenge/lean"},"name":"OAI.SpinAngle.TypeAngle.one_sided_type_angle","source":{"file":"lean/ComparatorChallenges/SpinAngle.lean","line":518,"pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","sha256":"d78fd35b20a9ff932f70739cea90fcc98cd1960e9e117b1c6f47217ee632620a","statement_sha256":"sha256:91fe0347486b72a733988428180edbc426103d526ef1a4072b5e7c778e83f96b","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/lean/ComparatorChallenges/SpinAngle.lean#L518"},"text":"theorem one_sided_type_angle (W : Finset (R × C))\n    (D : TypeLabel q) (H : C → TypeLabel q) (K : R → TypeLabel q)\n    (hD : D.size = W.card)\n    (hH : ∀ j, (H j).size = Fintype.card (TypeBlocks.Fiber (column W) j))\n    (hK : ∀ i, (K i).size = Fintype.card (TypeBlocks.Fiber (row W) i)) :\n    (‖TypeBlocks.projection (column W) H * TypeBlocks.projection (row W) K * D.projection W‖ ^ 2 ≤\n      min 1 (Real.exp (TypeBlocks.entropy H + TypeBlocks.entropy K - D.entropy) *\n        (TypeBlocks.dimension H : ℝ) * (TypeBlocks.dimension K : ℝ) * phi W)) ∧\n    (min 1 (Real.exp (TypeBlocks.entropy H + TypeBlocks.entropy K - D.entropy) *\n        (TypeBlocks.dimension H : ℝ) * (TypeBlocks.dimension K : ℝ) * phi W) ≤\n      min 1 (Real.exp (TypeBlocks.entropy H + TypeBlocks.entropy K - D.entropy +\n        (Fintype.card R * Fintype.card C - W.card : ℕ)) *\n        (TypeBlocks.dimension H : ℝ) * (TypeBlocks.dimension K : ℝ))) ∧\n    TypeBlocks.dimension H * TypeBlocks.dimension K ≤\n      (W.card + 1) ^ ((Fintype.card R + Fintype.card C) * q * (q - 1))"}],"state":"available","unresolved_names":[]},"generation_id":"sha256:fda4c3462963b650c538e2177794811eb1c221b267efea4b091fd6e397533f81","id":"l:SpinAngle","kind":"lean-preview","omissions":[],"pairings":{"f:238":{"alternatives":["pair:a1a2f2db81e8e1ae524caad2","pair:551e67e740b0913c2dc0e846","pair:ac195fc69a9394253e95ef46","pair:a5a6b38449bb9fff4941a7de","pair:a85f2c1c7cfbdd7d15037219","pair:cf9b5ea4a37c5c9a70b6dc00","pair:c948e84934e798ff660ed46b","pair:d25a4aba20761b3e44515e13","pair:b5dc276fcf4c710589b4559e","pair:b7186182db543eb3a7d95d2e","pair:7dd82a78f1f437dc60815fc0","pair:9fbf49b7924f0032af8c9f72","pair:b11067010308308c22bd18f7","pair:06547fc5d42217044729ab52","pair:acb049c5cdedefc167a2c351","pair:3e6c0edb79842aa8eed9d404"],"contributed_readings":[{"author":{"kind":"agent","name":"Codex source review 4"},"content_sha256":"sha256:9